Package: algorithmDiagnostics
Title: Diagnostic Plots for Evaluating Clinical Algorithm Biases
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Aartik", "Sarma", email = "aartik.sarma@ucsf.edu",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Generates diagnostic plots that evaluate clinical algorithms for
    conditional biases across subgroups. Provides percentile-level trends,
    quantile-aggregated point estimates with confidence intervals, LOESS
    smoothers, and beeswarm distribution strips assembled into multi-panel
    figures.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Imports:
    dplyr,
    ggbeeswarm,
    ggplot2,
    patchwork,
    rlang,
    scales,
    stats,
    tidyr
